-- expect-refusal: quantile's percent is an integer or a variable bound before it
-- examples/checks/agg-holistic-safety-9-refused-percent-late.rofl — a
-- percent bound only by a premise written after the quantile.
ahs_qlate(G, Q) :- ahs_group(G), Q is quantile(P, V ; K : ahs_line(G, K, V)), ahs_ask(G, P).
